:30.029" end="0:30.259">けて</span></p><p begin="0:30.262" end="0:32.112" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.262" end="0:30.482">妖</span><span begin="0:30.482" end="0:30.682">艶に</span><span begin="0:30.682" end="0:31.002">輝</span><span begin="0:31.002" end="0:31.122">く</span><span begin="0:31.122" end="0:31.342">君</span><span begin="0:31.342" end="0:31.472">は</span><span begin="0:31.472" end="0:32.112">killer</span></p><p begin="0:32.095" end="0:33.655" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.095" end="0:32.265">変</span><span begin="0:32.265" end="0:32.435">わっ</span><span begin="0:32.435" end="0:32.635">たそ</span><span begin="0:32.635" end="0:32.895">ぶりで</span><span begin="0:32.895" end="0:33.215">僕を</span><span begin="0:33.215" end="0:33.655">揶揄う</span></p><p begin="0:33.654" end="0:35.594" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.654" end="0:33.864">君</span><span begin="0:33.864" end="0:34.084">との</span><span begin="0:34.084" end="0:34.304">日々</span><span begin="0:34.304" end="0:34.464">が</span> <span begin="0:34.464" end="0:34.964">嫌</span><span begin="0:34.964" end="0:35.214">いじゃ</span><span begin="0:35.214" end="0:35.594">ない</span></p><p begin="0:35.747" end="0:37.917" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.747" end="0:35.937">Bro</span><span begin="0:35.937" end="0:36.207">ken</span> <span begin="0:36.207" end="0:36.397">mir</span><span begin="0:36.397" end="0:36.507">ror</span> <span begin="0:36.637" end="0:36.997">自</span><span begin="0:36.997" end="0:37.207">らこ</span><span begin="0:37.207" end="0:37.437">の世</span><span begin="0:37.437" end="0:37.617">を発</span><span begin="0:37.617" end="0:37.747">つ</span><span begin="0:37.747" end="0:37.917">から</span></p><p begin="0:37.916" end="0:40.086" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.916" end="0:38.066">未</span><span begin="0:38.066" end="0:38.506">来</span><span begin="0:38.506" end="0:38.666">は</span><span begin="0:38.666" end="0:39.246">ないん</span><span begin="0:3